(vector (map (:adr/authoritative_for (vector "kotoba-lang/kami-solar-helix-scene (new repo, https://github.com/kotoba-lang/kami-solar-helix-scene): zero-dep .cljc EDN authoring surface for the solar system's helical model, following the kami-atmosphere-scene/kami-cam-scene pattern (kotoba-lang/scene tolerant accessors) -- circular/coplanar orbital elements for the Sun + 8 planets, heliocentric-position-au (flat Sun-fixed view) vs galactic-frame-position-au (helical Sun-moving view, single-axis simplified transform), orbital-speed-km-s derived from radius/period and checked against published values, pitch-to-circumference-ratio showing the helix is a gentle stretched spring (~7.4x Earth, ~16.8x Jupiter) not a tight vortex, helix-tick per-frame convenience -- 15 tests/60 assertions green" "kami-engine rendering-capability finding: com-junkawasaki/kami-engine is empty (no commits); com-junkawasaki/kami-engine-sdk is a Svelte/TS VRM-viewer + document-scene bridge with no 3D primitive/orbit API; kotoba-lang/kami-engine and kami-*-scene/kami-engine-* siblings are mid clj-wgsl migration (ADR-2607010930) off a deleted Rust GPU workspace, with kami-engine-core/kami-engine-render explicitly \"Scaffold only\" and no adapter yet wired up for custom 3D scenes -- no pixel-output path exists for this data as of this ADR" "manifest/repos.edn + manifest/west.yml: orgs/kotoba-lang/kami-solar-helix-scene registered via --entry single-entry regeneration, pin verified against pushed main HEAD")), (:adr/supersedes (vector)), (:adr/superseded_by (vector)), (:adr/topic "kotoba-lang-kami-solar-helix-scene"), (:adr/related (vector)), (:adr/status "accepted"), (:adr/id "adr-2607072700-kotoba-lang-kami-solar-helix-scene"), (:adr/doc_type "adr"), (:adr/last_verified "2026-07-07"), (:adr/body "see 2607072700-kotoba-lang-kami-solar-helix-scene.edn"), (:adr/deciders (vector "Jun Kawasaki")), (:adr/artifacts "{:kami-solar-helix-scene \"kotoba-lang/kami-solar-helix-scene — new repo, 15 tests/60 assertions green (clojure -M:test)\"}"), (:adr/date "2026-07-07"), (:db/id -1), (:adr/authoritative true), (:adr/title "ADR-2607072700: kotoba-lang/kami-solar-helix-scene — solar helical-model EDN authoring surface"), (:adr/source-format "edn")))